    "northStar": "The Consulting Room at Dusk",
    "overview": "The app should feel like sitting across from Deborah in a quiet, warm consulting room in the early evening: soft parchment light, deep aubergine ink, a few precious gold details, and nothing on the desk that doesn't need to be there. It is a reading-and-listening experience first.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Beige canvas #fdf9f1, aubergine ink #291832; every readable text pair ≥ 7:1.",
      "Serif everywhere people read; SF Pro only for tiny functional text.",
      "Nothing heavier than Medium (500).",
      "Soft rounded geometry.",
      "Flat tonal layering; shadows only on floating elements.",
      "Deborah unboxed, user in lilac bubbles.",
      "No pills, tags, badges, chips, waves, ripples, shimmer or bounce."
    ],
